Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:06.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}To the finish with a flourish there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮地拿下最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Didn't she just do so very well to handle a moment{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她处理关键时刻的方式 确实漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.31,0:00:11.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}when 5-3 down in the opening set of this one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后 她硬是顶了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No love lost between these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这两人之间 早就没了客气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:25.03,TL,,0,0,0,,去年美网 比赛打完 戏才开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:29.12,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}赢了奥斯塔彭科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.86,TL,,0,0,0,,握手时 她被堵在网前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:34.37,TL,,0,0,0,,骂“没有风度 没有教养”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:36.03,TL,,0,0,0,,导火索是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:39.47,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘一记擦网弹过网带
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:42.57,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿下那分 却没举手道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.11,TL,,0,0,0,,今年温网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:47.78,TL,,0,0,0,,德约又一次擦网得分举手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Umpire calls 15-30.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N主裁报分 {\fs78}15{\fs68} 比 {\fs78}30{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.15,0:00:58.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I don't know if that was hit totally cleanly, but he'll take the result.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球打得不算干净 但结果他收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:01.72,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西在评论席当场开炮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:08.54,TL,,0,0,0,,我们能不能把“为擦网道歉”这习俗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:09.94,TL,,0,0,0,,废了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.56,TL,,0,0,0,,一个动作 有人当面开骂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:15.40,TL,,0,0,0,,名宿喊着废除
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:18.21,TL,,0,0,0,,可规则书里 没有“对不起”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:21.98,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}先把规则说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:25.01,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}回合中球擦网带过网 落入界内
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.01,0:01:27.81,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}规则第{\fs78}25{\fs68}条 好球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.46,TL,,0,0,0,,只有发球擦网才重发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:34.38,TL,,0,0,0,,那这一下手 是谁教的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:36.13,TL,,0,0,0,,没人说得清
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:39.71,TL,,0,0,0,,史家柯林斯说 来自英式绅士年代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:43.61,TL,,0,0,0,,哈勒普说 “从小就被教要道歉 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:50.51,TL,,0,0,0,,“做到后来 全是自动动作 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:52.71,TL,,0,0,0,,动作还分流派
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:56.65,TL,,0,0,0,,摊手的 举拍的 一挥而过的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:02.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Kenin's net cord — Australian Open final, 2020.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2020{\fs68} 澳网决赛 肯宁的擦网\N现场原声
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:06.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she's had all the luck with the net cords tonight…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她今晚擦网的运气全占了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's about three dead ones she's had.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种死擦网 已经第三个了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:12.74,TL,,0,0,0,,还有肯宁这种 擦网得了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:16.37,TL,,0,0,0,,抿着嘴转身就走 手都不举一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:19.95,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}先把去年那场架说完整
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:21.54,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:24.03,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德一记擦网弹高过网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:26.57,TL,,0,0,0,,对方救回 还是丢了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:37.48,TL,,0,0,0,,她转身回底线 没举手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:40.03,TL,,0,0,0,,握手时奥斯塔彭科当场发作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.86,TL,,0,0,0,,她这样转述
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:46.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Can you fill us in on the conversation you were having with Jelena out there?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能说说你们刚才在场上那番对话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's competition.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N竞技体育就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:51.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}People get upset when they lose.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N输球的人难免上火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:55.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Some people say bad things. She told me I have no class.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有人会说难听的话 她说我没有风度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:03:00.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have no education, and to see what happens when we get outside the US.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N说我没有教养 还说等离开美国再看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:03.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I beat her in Canada, outside the US. I beat her in New York, outside the US.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我在加拿大赢过她 在纽约也赢过她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:04.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So let's see what else she has to say.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N看她还有什么可说的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:07.02,TL,,0,0,0,,她说我没风度 没教养
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:09.06,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科在社媒写
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.49,TL,,0,0,0,,火来自那记“决定性时刻”的擦网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:16.16,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 网球里有些规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:18.40,TL,,0,0,0,,是大多数球员都会遵守的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:21.54,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她生涯第一次遇上有人不道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:30.46,TL,,0,0,0,,大坂直美公开批评她 舆论连吵几天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:33.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}天后 她发文道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:36.05,TL,,0,0,0,,英语非母语 “教养”指礼仪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:38.01,TL,,0,0,0,,汤森德接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:41.35,TL,,0,0,0,,不止她讨过这声“对不起”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:44.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年 梅德韦杰夫赢下西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.29,TL,,0,0,0,,握手第一句
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:53.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite a start on the year as a 2-6, 6-4, 6-2 win, and some words.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N逆转取胜 还附带一番口角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:55.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You don't say sorry, you think you're a good kid?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你不道歉 还觉得自己是个好孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.85,TL,,0,0,0,,另一边火力同样不弱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:01.25,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西后半句更狠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:05.54,TL,,0,0,0,,没人跟你道歉 这动作 天生单向
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:17.79,TL,,0,0,0,,那举手的人图什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.51,TL,,0,0,0,,莎拉波娃说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.02,TL,,0,0,0,,我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:23.60,TL,,0,0,0,,是因为我宁愿用一记干干净净的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.07,TL,,0,0,0,,制胜分 结束这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:29.79,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}别忘了 争论的起点是球本身
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:33.94,TL,,0,0,0,,有些擦网 擦掉的不是一分 是历史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.35,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1989{\fs68}年法网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:39.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}17{\fs68}岁的张德培对世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}伦德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:42.60,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘他抽筋到走不动 却在{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:45.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}时打出一记下手发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.42,TL,,0,0,0,,伦德尔被引到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.23,TL,,0,0,0,,穿越球擦着网带爬了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:55.62,TL,,0,0,0,,赛点上 伦德尔二发又擦到网带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:58.48,TL,,0,0,0,,弹出界外 双误 比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.95,TL,,0,0,0,,同一场 网带先帮张德培一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.09,TL,,0,0,0,,最后又替他收了尾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.28,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2020{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:16.13,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂姆淘汰纳达尔那场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.94,TL,,0,0,0,,擦网得分至少{\fs78}5{\fs68}次 举手也{\fs78}5{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.67,TL,,0,0,0,,其中{\fs78}3{\fs68}记 完整看一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:23.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Net cord No. 1 — first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网第一记 第一盘\N蒂姆网前擦网得分 原声
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:29.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A couple of years ago in the French Open final, when he had the tape — as we see this exchange…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几年前法网决赛他也遇过\N正说着 这一拍就擦上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:33.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Usually so efficient up at the net — not this time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他网前一向高效 这次没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:39.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Off the tape — Thiem spreads his hand in apology.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦带爬过 蒂姆随即摊手致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:44.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He actually had the tape under his sweat bands, as they get the apology there…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N胶带就缠在汗带下面\N看 致歉来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:48.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}…to try and keep them in place, because they were slipping down — so heavy with sweat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N怕汗带浸重了往下滑\N才缠在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Net cord No. 2 — set point, second-set tiebreak.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网第二记 抢七盘点\N现场原声
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Set point won off the tape — hand up in apology.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网得分拿下盘点 蒂姆举手致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:05.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he's certainly been that, Dominic Thiem, all the way through this contest.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N整场比赛 蒂姆都是这么打的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:19.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Net cord No. 3 — fourth-set tiebreak, match-point zone.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网第三记 抢七赛点区\N先有一段毛巾争议 原声
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm probably saying: you can't get the towel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N主裁的意思大概是\N现在不能拿毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:43.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's had a few of those. He had a net cord on the set point in the second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他这样擦网好几次了\N第二盘盘点也是擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:48.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Nadal doing everything right here — and Thiem just beats him flat out for pace.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N纳达尔什么都做对了\N蒂姆硬用速度压过去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:51.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Touches the tape as it goes over. It was that close.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N回放 球擦着网带过去\N就差这么一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:55.24,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次是真心 第五次呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:57.29,TL,,0,0,0,,画面自己会问
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.25,TL,,0,0,0,,没人能练擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.49,TL,,0,0,0,,它不认排名 不认苦练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:04.52,TL,,0,0,0,,只认那条白带
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:07.25,TL,,0,0,0,,所以这声“对不起”是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.63,TL,,0,0,0,,废除派说虚伪 坚守派说体面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:14.79,TL,,0,0,0,,省掉它的人被堵着讨说法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:17.42,TL,,0,0,0,,做足的人只想着下一分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:20.68,TL,,0,0,0,,没人真信 它却活了{\fs78}100{\fs68}多年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2007{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.08,TL,,0,0,0,,索德林擦网得分没致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:28.01,TL,,0,0,0,,还振臂庆祝 被纳达尔批评
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:32.34,TL,,0,0,0,,我人生最幸福的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:34.43,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么要说对不起？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.69,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}那么你说 擦网得分举起的那只手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:39.88,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}是礼貌还是演戏？
